    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "John Giltinane Auctioneer & Associates are delighted to present this traditional cottage residence situated on a generous 0.35-acre site in the heart of the  village of Granagh, Co. Limerick.\r\n\r\nThis property offers an excellent opportunity for purchasers seeking a renovation project with significant potential. The cottage retains its traditional character and enjoys a peaceful village setting while benefiting from a substantial site that may offer scope for further development, subject to the necessary planning permissions.\r\n\r\nThe property is likely to qualify for the Vacant/ Derelict  Property Refurbishment Grant and other available refurbishment incentives, making it an attractive proposition for owner-occupiers, investors, or those looking to create a charming countryside home.\r\n\r\nAccommodation:\r\nThe existing cottage provides a blank canvas for refurbishment and modernization, allowing prospective buyers to design and finish the property to their own specifications.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n-Traditional cottage residence\r\n-Situated on approximately 0.35 acres\r\n-Excellent redevelopment and refurbishment potential\r\n-Eligible purchasers may qualify for refurbishment grants (subject to scheme terms and conditions)\r\n-Located in the center of Granagh village\r\n-Large site with ample outdoor space\r\n-Quiet rural setting with strong community atmosphere\r\n-Convenient access to nearby towns and villages\r\n\r\nLocal Amenities:\r\nThe property enjoys a highly convenient location within walking distance of village amenities including:\r\n-Local national school\r\n-Church\r\n-Village shop\r\n-Public house/bar\r\n-Community center\r\n\r\n\r\nGranagh is a thriving village located within easy commuting distance of Kilmallock, Newcastle West, Charleville and Limerick City, offering the perfect balance of rural living and accessibility.\r\n\r\nViewing\r\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment."
      },
      {
